# Trivy ignore file — risk acceptance register (SecLead sign-off required).
# Entries here are ACCEPTED risks, not silence. Every entry MUST reference a
# tracking ticket with owner, reason, and a re-evaluation date. The CI step
# scripts/validate-risk-acceptance.js fails the build on any untracked entry.
# See docs/VULNERABILITY_MANAGEMENT.md §4 and docs/CICD_SECURITY_SCANNING.md §2.
#
# Format (one CVE/GHSA per line; tracking inline or on the following line):
# CVE-2099-99999  # tracking: CRE-000 # dev-only transitive dep, no prod exposure, re-eval 2026-11-01
# GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx
# # tracking: CRE-000 # second example, reason, re-eval 2026-11-01
